  "problem_text": "Find the smallest positive integer n or show no such n exists, with the following property: there are infinitely many distinct n-tuples of positive rational numbers (a_1, a_2, ..., a_n) such that both a_1+a_2+...+a_n and 1/a_1+1/a_2+...+1/a_n are integers.",
